(7365280, 1154110, 180170, '<td valign="top">My favorite one of the challenge, 10 and a blue ribbon from me, its just fab, great job :D</td>', 'My favorite one of the challenge, 10 and a blue ribbon from me, its just fab, great job :D', '2015-06-17 02:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365282, 1154330, 180170, '<td valign="top">love it, my second favorite :D</td>', 'love it, my second favorite :D', '2015-06-17 02:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365283, 1153319, 180170, '<td valign="top">Love that sun, this is fab. my third favorite one :D</td>', 'Love that sun, this is fab. my third favorite one :D', '2015-06-17 02:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365354, 1152777, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the title, not keen on the photo.</td>', 'Love the title, not keen on the photo.', '2015-06-17 07:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365357, 1154313, 67258, '<td valign="top">The woodlouse makes this for me.</td>', 'The woodlouse makes this for me.', '2015-06-17 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365359, 1153221, 67258, '<td valign="top">The textured over-lay suits the image.  Perhaps a bit bright in the middle ground, and for me a touch too much orange in the sepia toning.</td>', 'The textured over-lay suits the image.  Perhaps a bit bright in the middle ground, and for me a touch too much orange in the sepia toning.', '2015-06-17 07:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365360, 1153821, 67258, '<td valign="top">i like this, with its hint at a very rural location. Pleasingly simple and uncluttered.</td>', 'i like this, with its hint at a very rural location. Pleasingly simple and uncluttered.', '2015-06-17 07:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365361, 1154413, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2015-06-17 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365362, 1153618, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene well-framed, but the mass of details is hard on my eyes.</td>', 'An interesting scene well-framed, but the mass of details is hard on my eyes.', '2015-06-17 07:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365363, 1153116, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing image.</td>', 'A very pleasing image.', '2015-06-17 07:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365364, 1153252, 67258, '<td valign="top">How lovely!</td>', 'How lovely!', '2015-06-17 07:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365366, 1154400, 179769, '<td valign="top">Moody, made moodier by the muted colors.  Lovely.</td>', 'Moody, made moodier by the muted colors.  Lovely.', '2015-06-17 07:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365367, 1154323, 67258, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the different take on the challenge, but I am sure you would have got a better shot earlier or later in the day.</td>', 'I appreciate the different take on the challenge, but I am sure you would have got a better shot earlier or later in the day.', '2015-06-17 07:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365368, 1154254, 179769, '<td valign="top">The light skimming the tops of the headstones really makes this work...and the nightime sky, of course.  Good job.</td>', 'The light skimming the tops of the headstones really makes this work...and the nightime sky, of course.  Good job.', '2015-06-17 07:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365370, 1153511, 67258, '<td valign="top">what a perfect spot for a graveyard!</td>', 'what a perfect spot for a graveyard!', '2015-06-17 07:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365372, 1154512, 179769, '<td valign="top">A slightly lower angle would have made this more dramatic with more sky, less clutter behind.</td>', 'A slightly lower angle would have made this more dramatic with more sky, less clutter behind.', '2015-06-17 07:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365373, 1154293, 179769, '<td valign="top">Like the POV here.  Are those stars above her ......?</td>', 'Like the POV here.  Are those stars above her ......?', '2015-06-17 07:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365374, 1154030, 179769, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s a simple stone!  A pet perhaps?  Good job on lighting.</td>', 'Now, that''s a simple stone!  A pet perhaps?  Good job on lighting.', '2015-06-17 07:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365375, 1154192, 67258, '<td valign="top">This came up straight after ''Can I give you a hand?'' - love it when voting throws up matches like that :)<br/>Good composition and I like the out of focus foreground - gives the viewer a feeling of sneaking a peak.</td>', 'This came up straight after ''Can I give you a hand?'' - love it when voting throws up matches like that :)Good composition and I like the out of focus foreground - gives the viewer a feeling of sneaking a peak.', '2015-06-17 07:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365376, 1154100, 179769, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better, I think, with a darker exposure.  Like the perspective, though.</td>', 'This would have worked better, I think, with a darker exposure.  Like the perspective, though.', '2015-06-17 07:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365380, 1153955, 179769, '<td valign="top">That guy''s been pushing up daisies for a long time!  I like the single stone by itself in a field idea.  A different perspective from what I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'That guy''s been pushing up daisies for a long time!  I like the single stone by itself in a field idea.  A different perspective from what I''ve seen so far.', '2015-06-17 07:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365381, 1153776, 179769, '<td valign="top">I thought: The Old Wooden Cross.  I wish the trees weren''t there but the sunset is nice.</td>', 'I thought: The Old Wooden Cross.  I wish the trees weren''t there but the sunset is nice.', '2015-06-17 07:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365384, 1153319, 179769, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the perspective and the sunburst just makes it.</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the perspective and the sunburst just makes it.', '2015-06-17 07:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365386, 1153690, 179769, '<td valign="top">Unique!  Silouette is lovely. Good job.</td>', 'Unique!  Silouette is lovely. Good job.', '2015-06-17 07:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365387, 1154078, 179769, '<td valign="top">Deliciously spooky and the lighting is excellent!</td>', 'Deliciously spooky and the lighting is excellent!', '2015-06-17 07:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365388, 1154600, 179769, '<td valign="top">A neat idea, but the focus looks really off to me.</td>', 'A neat idea, but the focus looks really off to me.', '2015-06-17 07:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365391, 1154313, 179769, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Much more interesting than boring old gravestones.  :-)</td>', 'Nice job!  Much more interesting than boring old gravestones.  :-)', '2015-06-17 07:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365392, 1154476, 179769, '<td valign="top">"Orbs"!</td>', '"Orbs"!', '2015-06-17 07:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365393, 1154413, 179769, '<td valign="top">Intriquing!</td>', 'Intriquing!', '2015-06-17 07:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365394, 1152686, 179769, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look too happy to be where she is!  :-)  Good job of lighting her.</td>', 'She doesn''t look too happy to be where she is!  :-)  Good job of lighting her.', '2015-06-17 07:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365400, 1153252, 179769, '<td valign="top">Great catch, but would have scored higher if focus was sharper.</td>', 'Great catch, but would have scored higher if focus was sharper.', '2015-06-17 08:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365402, 1153101, 179769, '<td valign="top">Focus!</td>', 'Focus!', '2015-06-17 08:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365432, 1154512, 115814, '<td valign="top">Heaven and earth separated by the marker identifying the soul with dual citizenship. Wish I could read the writing on the stone.</td>', 'Heaven and earth separated by the marker identifying the soul with dual citizenship. Wish I could read the writing on the stone.', '2015-06-17 08:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365443, 1153243, 180696, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but too little subject and too much negative space.</td>', 'Sorry, but too little subject and too much negative space.', '2015-06-17 09:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365447, 1154582, 180696, '<td valign="top">This composition doesn''t quite work. The cropping can be more precise.</td>', 'This composition doesn''t quite work. The cropping can be more precise.', '2015-06-17 09:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365449, 1154488, 180696, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the idea comes across very well, just a pity about the cropping. Would have liked the foremost flag to be in the scene and not cropped off a little. There is also a halo effect on the left of the image, this could easily have been avoided.</td>', 'Nice image, the idea comes across very well, just a pity about the cropping. Would have liked the foremost flag to be in the scene and not cropped off a little. There is also a halo effect on the left of the image, this could easily have been avoided.', '2015-06-17 09:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365453, 1153126, 180696, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, love the black and white, just find the white patches at the top of the scene a little distracting, I feel that this could have been cropped out as it adds no value to the photograph.</td>', 'Lovely composition, love the black and white, just find the white patches at the top of the scene a little distracting, I feel that this could have been cropped out as it adds no value to the photograph.', '2015-06-17 09:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365454, 1154063, 115814, '<td valign="top">The structure in the background left is interesting and well isolated in front of the contrasting foliage. I wish it were more prominent I the image.</td>', 'The structure in the background left is interesting and well isolated in front of the contrasting foliage. I wish it were more prominent I the image.', '2015-06-17 09:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365455, 1153821, 180696, '<td valign="top">Lovely take on this one. Just try this... Look at the photo and imagine cropping off the very top part of the image where the stark white horizon is, it is a little disturbing and could be done without. Cropping to just above the posts, would be more than ample. One doesn''t always need to include the horizon, think out of the box sometimes. A very lovely photo though. :)</td>', 'Lovely take on this one. Just try this... Look at the photo and imagine cropping off the very top part of the image where the stark white horizon is, it is a little disturbing and could be done without. Cropping to just above the posts, would be more than ample. One doesn''t always need to include the horizon, think out of the box sometimes. A very lovely photo though. :)', '2015-06-17 09:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365458, 1153917, 180696, '<td valign="top">Firstly the composition is dead centred. This image could very much have been taken more from the front with a straightened horizon. I don''t immediately get the "Graveyard" feel to this. I do see the feint image on the left door, but this just makes it feel more like this is just a church rather than a graveyard or even the feel of a graveyard. The image is extremely badly cropped, not to mention very grainy even though it may be the stone affecting the image.</td>', 'Firstly the composition is dead centred. This image could very much have been taken more from the front with a straightened horizon. I don''t immediately get the "Graveyard" feel to this. I do see the feint image on the left door, but this just makes it feel more like this is just a church rather than a graveyard or even the feel of a graveyard. The image is extremely badly cropped, not to mention very grainy even though it may be the stone affecting the image.', '2015-06-17 09:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365464, 1153080, 180696, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what went wrong here... Unfortunately I cannot find anything positive to state about this image. It''s all washed out, over post-processed and very over-exposed, and no proper composition was taken into consideration here.</td>', 'Don''t know what went wrong here... Unfortunately I cannot find anything positive to state about this image. It''s all washed out, over post-processed and very over-exposed, and no proper composition was taken into consideration here.', '2015-06-17 09:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365470, 1154551, 180696, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say, but this image seems very washed out for me. Taken at the wrong time of the day to try to give this image a more professional feel.  The lines aren''t straight and this should definitely be taken into consideration in future. The rule of thirds was unfortunately not taken into account and therefore also lends to somewhat boring image. I''m sure that this image could have been taken much better with more consideration of what one want''s to achieve. There was no thought process here. If taken at an obtuse angle with intent, then it could''ve worked, but also at the right time of the day - not mid-day.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say, but this image seems very washed out for me. Taken at the wrong time of the day to try to give this image a more professional feel.  The lines aren''t straight and this should definitely be taken into consideration in future. The rule of thirds was unfortunately not taken into account and therefore also lends to somewhat boring image. I''m sure that this image could have been taken much better with more consideration of what one want''s to achieve. There was no thought process here. If taken at an obtuse angle with intent, then it could''ve worked, but also at the right time of the day - not mid-day.', '2015-06-17 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
