(7365558, 1154330, 180696, '<td valign="top">Lovely concept and well captured. I just have one concern and that is that the photo is too centred and not adding to the overall value to the shot.</td>', 'Lovely concept and well captured. I just have one concern and that is that the photo is too centred and not adding to the overall value to the shot.', '2015-06-17 10:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365561, 1154436, 180696, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept. The idea works very well, but I feel that the tilt affect works better if not tilted too much. This makes me want to hold my laptop at an angle to be able to see what is happening here. Try a little less tilt next time. Otherwise a lovely shot!</td>', 'Very nice concept. The idea works very well, but I feel that the tilt affect works better if not tilted too much. This makes me want to hold my laptop at an angle to be able to see what is happening here. Try a little less tilt next time. Otherwise a lovely shot!', '2015-06-17 10:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365564, 1154544, 180696, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the leading lines. I would''ve just dropped the exposure a fraction as the image is a little bright and looks a little like a holiday snap.</td>', 'Nice, I like the leading lines. I would''ve just dropped the exposure a fraction as the image is a little bright and looks a little like a holiday snap.', '2015-06-17 10:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
