(7365566, 1153866, 180696, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and I get the idea with the tomb effect, but a little too blown out and over post-processed. A little too much burn going on.</td>', 'I like the concept and I get the idea with the tomb effect, but a little too blown out and over post-processed. A little too much burn going on.', '2015-06-17 10:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
