(7365575, 1154100, 180696, '<td valign="top">Taken at an even lower angle here would have worked even better, time of the day would definitely have an impact as well as this is simply a picture of a few graves with a church in the background. Your whites are too white and a little washed out. I''m not sure whether you actually intended in having the flag in the composition or not!? It is very tightly cropped.</td>', 'Taken at an even lower angle here would have worked even better, time of the day would definitely have an impact as well as this is simply a picture of a few graves with a church in the background. Your whites are too white and a little washed out. I''m not sure whether you actually intended in having the flag in the composition or not!? It is very tightly cropped.', '2015-06-17 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365578, 1154351, 177322, '<td valign="top">Creative PoV. There seems to be a misty, soft quality to the air which imparts a sense of serenity.</td>', 'Creative PoV. There seems to be a misty, soft quality to the air which imparts a sense of serenity.', '2015-06-17 11:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365579, 1154330, 12611, '<td valign="top">Somehow, Although it adds a good effect to the perception of phantasmic revelation, the very straight stone through the body distracts a bit.</td>', 'Somehow, Although it adds a good effect to the perception of phantasmic revelation, the very straight stone through the body distracts a bit.', '2015-06-17 11:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365580, 1154581, 180696, '<td valign="top">Yes, I get the idea of a graveyard, but there are a few issues I have, firstly with the bright spots coming through the trees and the then the tombs are not quite cropped well. You could have dropped the camera even lower and caught more of the foreground tomb. I am also not sure whether the image is a black and white or not. Blacks, greys and whites aren''t distinguished enough. Just some constructive criticism.</td>', 'Yes, I get the idea of a graveyard, but there are a few issues I have, firstly with the bright spots coming through the trees and the then the tombs are not quite cropped well. You could have dropped the camera even lower and caught more of the foreground tomb. I am also not sure whether the image is a black and white or not. Blacks, greys and whites aren''t distinguished enough. Just some constructive criticism.', '2015-06-17 11:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365581, 1154370, 12611, '<td valign="top">great composition.</td>', 'great composition.', '2015-06-17 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365582, 1153703, 180696, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo and great editing. I like it.</td>', 'A lovely photo and great editing. I like it.', '2015-06-17 11:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
