(7365607, 1153042, 177322, '<td valign="top">For me, personally, the infrared does not work.  Nonetheless the composition with the stones in front of the church subtlety framed by the trees is quite well done.</td>', 'For me, personally, the infrared does not work.  Nonetheless the composition with the stones in front of the church subtlety framed by the trees is quite well done.', '2015-06-17 11:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365608, 1154193, 43191, '<td valign="top">wondering if the sun and lens flare would have more impact off centre? The fence as a barrier between the viewer and the cemetery gives both a feeling of annoyance at being excluded from the scene and relief that I am somehow separated from this place that defines the end of life.</td>', 'wondering if the sun and lens flare would have more impact off centre? The fence as a barrier between the viewer and the cemetery gives both a feeling of annoyance at being excluded from the scene and relief that I am somehow separated from this place that defines the end of life.', '2015-06-17 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365609, 1153776, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a powerful interpretation of this most unique marker. Well done.</td>', 'What a powerful interpretation of this most unique marker. Well done.', '2015-06-17 11:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365610, 1152894, 180696, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, just one little issue here and that is the blown-out whites. One must be very careful with that. If there were distinct beams of light coming through the trees and branches, you would get away with it, but this is purely blown-out. Professional photography doesn''t allow for this. A rule of thirds could also have been better executed.</td>', 'A nice concept, just one little issue here and that is the blown-out whites. One must be very careful with that. If there were distinct beams of light coming through the trees and branches, you would get away with it, but this is purely blown-out. Professional photography doesn''t allow for this. A rule of thirds could also have been better executed.', '2015-06-17 11:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365611, 1153911, 43191, '<td valign="top">An interesting place. I have not seen this before. Would kind of like to see the other wall included in the shot as I can see a hint of flowers there. Well done on the exposure with the glass.</td>', 'An interesting place. I have not seen this before. Would kind of like to see the other wall included in the shot as I can see a hint of flowers there. Well done on the exposure with the glass.', '2015-06-17 11:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
