(7365617, 1154293, 177322, '<td valign="top">Composition, color, focus - all exceptional  The raindrops impart a mystical quality making this a most all-around magical image.  Good luck with it.</td>', 'Composition, color, focus - all exceptional  The raindrops impart a mystical quality making this a most all-around magical image.  Good luck with it.', '2015-06-17 11:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365618, 1153744, 43191, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very crowded cemetery! Nice placement of the Jesus statue.</td>', 'This looks like a very crowded cemetery! Nice placement of the Jesus statue.', '2015-06-17 11:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365619, 1154241, 180696, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure whether this fits the bill here. I understand that you are trying to think out of the box, but the photo doesn''t really tell me a story, it''s too confusing and not quite a graveyard of sorts... The rule of thirds has not been applied and therefore the image looks boring and out of place. It also looks too fabricated, sorry</td>', 'Not quite sure whether this fits the bill here. I understand that you are trying to think out of the box, but the photo doesn''t really tell me a story, it''s too confusing and not quite a graveyard of sorts... The rule of thirds has not been applied and therefore the image looks boring and out of place. It also looks too fabricated, sorry', '2015-06-17 11:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365620, 1154096, 43191, '<td valign="top">Very sad.</td>', 'Very sad.', '2015-06-17 11:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365621, 1154508, 43191, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the heart ornament in the foreground. It gives a point of interest to the shot.</td>', 'I like the use of the heart ornament in the foreground. It gives a point of interest to the shot.', '2015-06-17 11:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365623, 1154506, 43191, '<td valign="top">The stone at the end of the path makes the shot. Maybe a little too much foreground?</td>', 'The stone at the end of the path makes the shot. Maybe a little too much foreground?', '2015-06-17 11:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365624, 1154561, 43191, '<td valign="top">Sad scene. Glad they are remembered in some way.</td>', 'Sad scene. Glad they are remembered in some way.', '2015-06-17 11:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365626, 1152777, 180696, '<td valign="top">Firstly, I must say that there is a total lack of composition here. The blurred image and the washed-out whites adds negatively to this image. Those could just as well have been road markers on the edge of the road. The portrayal of the theme doesn''t come across very well here. The overall greyscale isn''t executed either.</td>', 'Firstly, I must say that there is a total lack of composition here. The blurred image and the washed-out whites adds negatively to this image. Those could just as well have been road markers on the edge of the road. The portrayal of the theme doesn''t come across very well here. The overall greyscale isn''t executed either.', '2015-06-17 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365627, 1154605, 43191, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the side of the monument. Maybe a little less centred would have been better.</td>', 'Nice light on the side of the monument. Maybe a little less centred would have been better.', '2015-06-17 11:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365631, 1153319, 43191, '<td valign="top">This looks like somewhere in fiction. Lovely tree, sunbeams add a spiritual feeling to the shot.</td>', 'This looks like somewhere in fiction. Lovely tree, sunbeams add a spiritual feeling to the shot.', '2015-06-17 11:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365632, 1153533, 180696, '<td valign="top">A lovely colourful image. I would have just like to see some better cropping though. The bits encroaching on the right-hand side of the image is distracting and could be cropped out. Furthermore not too shabby :)</td>', 'A lovely colourful image. I would have just like to see some better cropping though. The bits encroaching on the right-hand side of the image is distracting and could be cropped out. Furthermore not too shabby :)', '2015-06-17 11:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365634, 1154301, 180696, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something out-of-the-box</td>', 'Nice to see something out-of-the-box', '2015-06-17 11:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365636, 1154376, 180696, '<td valign="top">It''s a great photo, well executed with good colour and saturation and composition! A good find and well processed! :)</td>', 'It''s a great photo, well executed with good colour and saturation and composition! A good find and well processed! :)', '2015-06-17 11:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365638, 1154603, 177322, '<td valign="top">Gritty.  Tumultuous. I like the way the positioning of the stones circles the eye back around through the image.</td>', 'Gritty.  Tumultuous. I like the way the positioning of the stones circles the eye back around through the image.', '2015-06-17 11:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365642, 1153056, 180696, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this image makes me dizzy! This idea was not thought through very well in terms of composition and colour and too much negative space. Keep that in mind next time.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this image makes me dizzy! This idea was not thought through very well in terms of composition and colour and too much negative space. Keep that in mind next time.', '2015-06-17 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365643, 1153575, 180696, '<td valign="top">Looks like a well executed HDR photo. Love it! The theme, cropping and post-processing is great! Absolutely taken at the right time of the day! Well done!! :)</td>', 'Looks like a well executed HDR photo. Love it! The theme, cropping and post-processing is great! Absolutely taken at the right time of the day! Well done!! :)', '2015-06-17 11:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365645, 1153821, 177322, '<td valign="top">These are the saddest ones and this one is especially poignant.  Your work is a beautiful tribute to this mournful ending.</td>', 'These are the saddest ones and this one is especially poignant.  Your work is a beautiful tribute to this mournful ending.', '2015-06-17 11:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365646, 1154187, 180696, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is good. Unfortunately your whites are washed out and breaks the overall image down. Lovely idea, but the cropping makes this too centred. No rule-of-thirds were used here.</td>', 'The depth of field is good. Unfortunately your whites are washed out and breaks the overall image down. Lovely idea, but the cropping makes this too centred. No rule-of-thirds were used here.', '2015-06-17 11:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365647, 1152893, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a sad situation - headstones broken and stacked, no longer serving their purpose of marking eternal resting places.  This is a fresh and creative interpretation of the challenge.  Good eye.</td>', 'What a sad situation - headstones broken and stacked, no longer serving their purpose of marking eternal resting places.  This is a fresh and creative interpretation of the challenge.  Good eye.', '2015-06-17 11:39:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7365650, 1153992, 180696, '<td valign="top">You got the idea, I''m just not sure whether the "gaussian blur" worked... ?</td>', 'You got the idea, I''m just not sure whether the "gaussian blur" worked... ?', '2015-06-17 11:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365652, 1154548, 177322, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh!  This probably has to be one of the most unique stones in this challenge.</td>', 'Oh my gosh!  This probably has to be one of the most unique stones in this challenge.', '2015-06-17 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365653, 1153744, 180696, '<td valign="top">Good to see that you got a good balance in the tones. The composition is great and well executed. Lovely photo!</td>', 'Good to see that you got a good balance in the tones. The composition is great and well executed. Lovely photo!', '2015-06-17 11:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365655, 1153263, 177322, '<td valign="top">The sweep of the bark and the misty atmosphere work together to create a serene setting.  The slight desaturation works well.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'The sweep of the bark and the misty atmosphere work together to create a serene setting.  The slight desaturation works well.  Nicely seen.', '2015-06-17 11:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365657, 1154030, 177322, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this image is compelling.</td>', 'The simplicity of this image is compelling.', '2015-06-17 11:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365658, 1154459, 180696, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s a graveyard or it has that feel, I just feel that the effect tends to take away too much of the subject matter. Another thing is the "black hole" at the top right of the image lends nothing positive to the over-all image.</td>', 'Yes, it''s a graveyard or it has that feel, I just feel that the effect tends to take away too much of the subject matter. Another thing is the "black hole" at the top right of the image lends nothing positive to the over-all image.', '2015-06-17 11:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365660, 1153484, 177322, '<td valign="top">Quite unusual find.  The blue monochrome works well.</td>', 'Quite unusual find.  The blue monochrome works well.', '2015-06-17 11:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365663, 1153920, 180696, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant colours and the fact that the image was taken at a low angle, it leads to a good sense of height and leads the eye upwards. One thing though, the subject matter is too centred, the rule of thirds would definitely have added value to this image and it''s over-all feel. Otherwise I like it. :)</td>', 'I love the vibrant colours and the fact that the image was taken at a low angle, it leads to a good sense of height and leads the eye upwards. One thing though, the subject matter is too centred, the rule of thirds would definitely have added value to this image and it''s over-all feel. Otherwise I like it. :)', '2015-06-17 11:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365668, 1153049, 180696, '<td valign="top">Great tones! Good leading-lines and good processing! Great Job! :)</td>', 'Great tones! Good leading-lines and good processing! Great Job! :)', '2015-06-17 11:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365670, 1153869, 180696, '<td valign="top">Yes, its a graveyard, but extremely distracting background! Surely you could''ve used a different angle to avoid all the distraction going on.</td>', 'Yes, its a graveyard, but extremely distracting background! Surely you could''ve used a different angle to avoid all the distraction going on.', '2015-06-17 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365707, 1153222, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is just my opinion and what I see, please don''t take it personally. <br/> <br/>I don''t care for the selective desaturation and here''s why. First the grass itself is hard to remove color from when you''re using a paint brush tool in photoshop or similar program. You also missed a spot just in front, in the middle of those the two front flowers and through out the photo in other spots as well. <br/> <br/>Also when you desaturate an object it is pretty much saying ignore me. With the challenge being graveyard I would think you would inverse the desat so everything else was ignored except the tombstones. <br/> <br/>There are a few other things I could critique in this image and I can do so if you like, for now I will just leave it there. <br/> <br/>Not all minds work the same and not everyone see''s the same images when photographing them so again, This is just my opinion and what I see, please don''t take it personally.</td>', 'This is just my opinion and what I see, please don''t take it personally.  I don''t care for the selective desaturation and here''s why. First the grass itself is hard to remove color from when you''re using a paint brush tool in photoshop or similar program. You also missed a spot just in front, in the middle of those the two front flowers and through out the photo in other spots as well.  Also when you desaturate an object it is pretty much saying ignore me. With the challenge being graveyard I would think you would inverse the desat so everything else was ignored except the tombstones.  There are a few other things I could critique in this image and I can do so if you like, for now I will just leave it there.  Not all minds work the same and not everyone see''s the same images when photographing them so again, This is just my opinion and what I see, please don''t take it personally.', '2015-06-17 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365710, 1153575, 129807, '<td valign="top">I feel the processing is a little heavy for the image, almost taking on a surreal quality and although it is a balanced composition, it lacks a focal point.</td>', 'I feel the processing is a little heavy for the image, almost taking on a surreal quality and although it is a balanced composition, it lacks a focal point.', '2015-06-17 12:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365711, 1154110, 51793, '<td valign="top">I''ve been away for a while and I''m not sure but this looks like something <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a> would do.</td>', 'I''ve been away for a while and I''m not sure but this looks like something  Judi would do.', '2015-06-17 12:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365712, 1154488, 129807, '<td valign="top">Good composition with a slightly desaturated finish which suits the subject.</td>', 'Good composition with a slightly desaturated finish which suits the subject.', '2015-06-17 12:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365713, 1154586, 129807, '<td valign="top">Interesting monument. Love the sky behind although it feels a little grainy.</td>', 'Interesting monument. Love the sky behind although it feels a little grainy.', '2015-06-17 12:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365715, 1154388, 129807, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing of morbid subject matter but I find little to hold my attention.</td>', 'Interesting framing of morbid subject matter but I find little to hold my attention.', '2015-06-17 12:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365717, 1154542, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''m definitely not a fan of white vignettes (or the pinkish colour treatment in this case) but the composition draws me into your image regardless.</td>', 'I''m definitely not a fan of white vignettes (or the pinkish colour treatment in this case) but the composition draws me into your image regardless.', '2015-06-17 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365720, 1154591, 129807, '<td valign="top">Creepy but effective processing. Perhaps a smidge too light on the stones.</td>', 'Creepy but effective processing. Perhaps a smidge too light on the stones.', '2015-06-17 12:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365722, 1154175, 51793, '<td valign="top">BLUE right here. Good job</td>', 'BLUE right here. Good job', '2015-06-17 12:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365724, 1153116, 129807, '<td valign="top">Although she''s a beautiful guardian, I''m not drawn to linger long. She almost fades into the background.</td>', 'Although she''s a beautiful guardian, I''m not drawn to linger long. She almost fades into the background.', '2015-06-17 12:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365725, 1154551, 129807, '<td valign="top">Creepy sentinels.</td>', 'Creepy sentinels.', '2015-06-17 12:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365726, 1154602, 129807, '<td valign="top">More a photo of the tree, but it works. Looks like a peaceful resting place.</td>', 'More a photo of the tree, but it works. Looks like a peaceful resting place.', '2015-06-17 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365729, 1153992, 129807, '<td valign="top">The line of stones speak of age and a simpler time; the green tones overpower the image.</td>', 'The line of stones speak of age and a simpler time; the green tones overpower the image.', '2015-06-17 12:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365731, 1154496, 129807, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the border, I would have thought this image decades old.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the border, I would have thought this image decades old.', '2015-06-17 12:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365732, 1154436, 51793, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty badass image but I don''t know if it''s allowed.</td>', 'It''s a pretty badass image but I don''t know if it''s allowed.', '2015-06-17 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365742, 1154110, 163081, '<td valign="top">Winner. This one stands out from the whole bunch. <br/>A nice big 10 from me</td>', 'Winner. This one stands out from the whole bunch. A nice big 10 from me', '2015-06-17 12:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365760, 1154241, 67258, '<td valign="top">Amongst my favourites in this challenge.<br/>Hope you saved the bird for ''feathers''!</td>', 'Amongst my favourites in this challenge.Hope you saved the bird for ''feathers''!', '2015-06-17 12:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365862, 1153360, 177322, '<td valign="top">Quite spectacular.  You captured a vibrant mood.</td>', 'Quite spectacular.  You captured a vibrant mood.', '2015-06-17 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365863, 1154058, 177322, '<td valign="top">This feels so ancient.</td>', 'This feels so ancient.', '2015-06-17 15:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365867, 1153116, 177322, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge. Perfect filter choice.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge. Perfect filter choice.', '2015-06-17 15:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365868, 1153067, 177322, '<td valign="top">This is extra powerful with the brooding sky and still-wet stones.  7</td>', 'This is extra powerful with the brooding sky and still-wet stones.  7', '2015-06-17 15:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365871, 1154011, 177322, '<td valign="top">I do this, too: fill my frame with so many things to look at that the viewer''s eye does not where to rest.  There are plenty of interesting items but because the way it is framed and the DoF, it all becomes very jumbled and Larry sort of gets lost in it all.  The colors are captivating but the upper flare is distracting.</td>', 'I do this, too: fill my frame with so many things to look at that the viewer''s eye does not where to rest.  There are plenty of interesting items but because the way it is framed and the DoF, it all becomes very jumbled and Larry sort of gets lost in it all.  The colors are captivating but the upper flare is distracting.', '2015-06-17 15:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365872, 1154314, 177322, '<td valign="top">Elegant.</td>', 'Elegant.', '2015-06-17 15:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365873, 1153703, 177322, '<td valign="top">Quite eye-catching.</td>', 'Quite eye-catching.', '2015-06-17 15:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365877, 1153319, 177322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B&amp;W.</td>', 'Beautiful B&W.', '2015-06-17 15:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365878, 1154237, 177322, '<td valign="top">So perky - makes me smile.</td>', 'So perky - makes me smile.', '2015-06-17 15:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365880, 1154582, 177322, '<td valign="top">What an interesting ''landscape'' anchored by the Guardian.</td>', 'What an interesting ''landscape'' anchored by the Guardian.', '2015-06-17 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365881, 1153412, 177322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, nicely composed. This could, in my opinion, be front page material.</td>', 'Beautiful light, nicely composed. This could, in my opinion, be front page material.', '2015-06-17 15:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365883, 1153575, 177322, '<td valign="top">You may get some criticism for the high saturation but I, personally, like it. Expertly composed.  Best of luck for making the front page line-up.</td>', 'You may get some criticism for the high saturation but I, personally, like it. Expertly composed.  Best of luck for making the front page line-up.', '2015-06-17 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365885, 1154591, 177322, '<td valign="top">A very spooky interpretation.  Quite effective filter.</td>', 'A very spooky interpretation.  Quite effective filter.', '2015-06-17 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365886, 1154497, 177322, '<td valign="top">The desaturation is effective and brings out the character of the stone.  Perhaps the composition is a tad too centered?</td>', 'The desaturation is effective and brings out the character of the stone.  Perhaps the composition is a tad too centered?', '2015-06-17 16:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365887, 1154394, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nice to find humor in this challenge.  Perhaps the processing is too harsh - not a lot of mid-range tones.  My apologies, however, if you were intending a high contrast image.  Either way - a most unique capture.</td>', 'Nice to find humor in this challenge.  Perhaps the processing is too harsh - not a lot of mid-range tones.  My apologies, however, if you were intending a high contrast image.  Either way - a most unique capture.', '2015-06-17 16:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365899, 1152777, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like that the earth is round... and the warm toning is perfectly suited.</td>', 'I like that the earth is round... and the warm toning is perfectly suited.', '2015-06-17 16:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365918, 1153080, 86447, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper and with more contrast.   Something odd going on with the trees...</td>', 'Could be sharper and with more contrast.   Something odd going on with the trees...', '2015-06-17 16:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365920, 1154110, 86447, '<td valign="top">Yep.   This is lovely.     In my top three.</td>', 'Yep.   This is lovely.     In my top three.', '2015-06-17 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365921, 1152946, 86447, '<td valign="top">Unique with the cat... but not really attention-grabbing for a really high score, I fear.</td>', 'Unique with the cat... but not really attention-grabbing for a really high score, I fear.', '2015-06-17 17:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365959, 1153746, 179769, '<td valign="top">Love that the sign is just slightly off-center.   Really effective!</td>', 'Love that the sign is just slightly off-center.   Really effective!', '2015-06-17 18:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365960, 1154239, 179769, '<td valign="top">The moody muted color is really beautiful.</td>', 'The moody muted color is really beautiful.', '2015-06-17 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365962, 1154602, 179769, '<td valign="top">Could do with better focus and more contrast, but the sun flare is lovely.</td>', 'Could do with better focus and more contrast, but the sun flare is lovely.', '2015-06-17 18:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365963, 1153992, 179769, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the messy vignette and some color balance is needed to reduce some of the green.</td>', 'I don''t care for the messy vignette and some color balance is needed to reduce some of the green.', '2015-06-17 18:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365964, 1154607, 179769, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but way too dark.</td>', 'This is nice, but way too dark.', '2015-06-17 18:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365967, 1154497, 179769, '<td valign="top">Is there a blue halo around the top......?</td>', 'Is there a blue halo around the top......?', '2015-06-17 18:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365968, 1153866, 179769, '<td valign="top">It''s spelled "tomb"....   :-)   Beautiful photo, though.</td>', 'It''s spelled "tomb"....   :-)   Beautiful photo, though.', '2015-06-17 18:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365977, 1154459, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the lacy wispyness to this image.  It matches the text on the feminine headstone.</td>', 'I love the lacy wispyness to this image.  It matches the text on the feminine headstone.', '2015-06-17 18:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365978, 1154607, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely find!   Could be a bit brighter to showcase your angel a bit more.</td>', 'Lovely find!   Could be a bit brighter to showcase your angel a bit more.', '2015-06-17 18:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365979, 1153690, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.   Could be a bit sharper silhouette...   Maybe a tripod would fix?</td>', 'Lovely scene.   Could be a bit sharper silhouette...   Maybe a tripod would fix?', '2015-06-17 18:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365983, 1154317, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love all of this... except for how much space her back takes up.  I see your reasons for not showing her face, but maybe if she were sitting a little more to the right... it might be a more pleasing composition.   I dunno...</td>', 'I love all of this... except for how much space her back takes up.  I see your reasons for not showing her face, but maybe if she were sitting a little more to the right... it might be a more pleasing composition.   I dunno...', '2015-06-17 18:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365984, 1153575, 86447, '<td valign="top">Lovely light!    Well done.</td>', 'Lovely light!    Well done.', '2015-06-17 18:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365994, 1154334, 177322, '<td valign="top">The golden sparkle is stunning.  Hope this ends up on the front page.</td>', 'The golden sparkle is stunning.  Hope this ends up on the front page.', '2015-06-17 19:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366020, 1153794, 138630, '<td valign="top">Interesting tones.  Not a fan of what the vignette does in the sky, but I do like the depth of field.</td>', 'Interesting tones.  Not a fan of what the vignette does in the sky, but I do like the depth of field.', '2015-06-17 20:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366022, 1154548, 138630, '<td valign="top">The anonymity of the plot numbering system.  Another loss of identity, in death as in life.</td>', 'The anonymity of the plot numbering system.  Another loss of identity, in death as in life.', '2015-06-17 20:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366027, 1154480, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice light.  I find what I take to be lens distortion on the structure regrettable.  Including the tree on the right balances the composition nicely.</td>', 'Nice light.  I find what I take to be lens distortion on the structure regrettable.  Including the tree on the right balances the composition nicely.', '2015-06-17 20:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366028, 1154255, 138630, '<td valign="top">Colors, light, comp are all stunning.  Too bad about the block of white sky.  I do like the way the flowers are tucked into the curve of the marker as if embraced by it.</td>', 'Colors, light, comp are all stunning.  Too bad about the block of white sky.  I do like the way the flowers are tucked into the curve of the marker as if embraced by it.', '2015-06-17 20:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366030, 1154373, 138630, '<td valign="top">What is that up by her face?  Looks like a strangely large and floating hand.  The idea here, suggesting a story, is good.  But I find the strangeness of the figure distracting.<br/> <br/>oops back to edit.  I have finally figured it out.  She has a veil in front of her face.  My monitor is too dark to allow me to make it out easily.  And the floating hand is actually the stems of the bouquet.  Sorry.</td>', 'What is that up by her face?  Looks like a strangely large and floating hand.  The idea here, suggesting a story, is good.  But I find the strangeness of the figure distracting. oops back to edit.  I have finally figured it out.  She has a veil in front of her face.  My monitor is too dark to allow me to make it out easily.  And the floating hand is actually the stems of the bouquet.  Sorry.', '2015-06-17 20:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366082, 1153739, 98141, '<td valign="top">that''s a great sign</td>', 'that''s a great sign', '2015-06-17 22:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366119, 1154373, 129807, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this with about 3/4 of the top row cropped off and the remaining leaves cloned out.</td>', 'I would like to see this with about 3/4 of the top row cropped off and the remaining leaves cloned out.', '2015-06-18 00:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366120, 1153917, 129807, '<td valign="top">:::chuckle:::</td>', ':::chuckle:::', '2015-06-18 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366121, 1154400, 129807, '<td valign="top">Processing has been pushed a little here - it feels almost gritty.</td>', 'Processing has been pushed a little here - it feels almost gritty.', '2015-06-18 00:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366178, 1153575, 62249, '<td valign="top">The processing works nicely for the right 2/3 of the image (building, headstones) but looks too artificial on the trees. Still, nicely composed, fits the challenge well, and I like it.</td>', 'The processing works nicely for the right 2/3 of the image (building, headstones) but looks too artificial on the trees. Still, nicely composed, fits the challenge well, and I like it.', '2015-06-18 02:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366180, 1154413, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Wouldn''t have thought an infrared look would be a good approach for the challenge, but it works pretty well on this image. Maybe a slightly tighter crop on the left to eliminate the bright spot above the wall.</td>', 'Very interesting. Wouldn''t have thought an infrared look would be a good approach for the challenge, but it works pretty well on this image. Maybe a slightly tighter crop on the left to eliminate the bright spot above the wall.', '2015-06-18 02:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366181, 1154469, 62249, '<td valign="top">Tricky to get a good exposure in contrasty light, but you did it.</td>', 'Tricky to get a good exposure in contrasty light, but you did it.', '2015-06-18 02:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366182, 1153116, 62249, '<td valign="top">The texture works well for this image.</td>', 'The texture works well for this image.', '2015-06-18 02:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366184, 1154313, 62249, '<td valign="top">Okay, first: Ewwww! Second, great idea for the challenge and well shot. One nitpick: the larger chunk of compost to the left of the hand is distracting. I find myself wondering why that chunk is so different from the rest. Is it some sort of clue I''m supposed to unravel?</td>', 'Okay, first: Ewwww! Second, great idea for the challenge and well shot. One nitpick: the larger chunk of compost to the left of the hand is distracting. I find myself wondering why that chunk is so different from the rest. Is it some sort of clue I''m supposed to unravel?', '2015-06-18 02:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366187, 1154561, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nicely moody. A bit too dark on the left.</td>', 'Nicely moody. A bit too dark on the left.', '2015-06-18 02:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366189, 1154461, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the face of the larger monument in the foreground. Would''ve benefitted from a bit more light, say, from a reflector, on the left side to show more detail there.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the face of the larger monument in the foreground. Would''ve benefitted from a bit more light, say, from a reflector, on the left side to show more detail there.', '2015-06-18 02:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366190, 1153252, 62249, '<td valign="top">Heh, cute title. And decent image. Maybe dodge the deer''s nose slightly to give it more visual separation from the gravestone behind it.</td>', 'Heh, cute title. And decent image. Maybe dodge the deer''s nose slightly to give it more visual separation from the gravestone behind it.', '2015-06-18 02:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366194, 1154584, 62249, '<td valign="top">That''s quite an assemblage of colorful stuff for a girl long dead. Maybe shooting from a lower angle up toward the grave marker, with the colorful stuff forming a prominent foreground, might make the shot even more interesting.</td>', 'That''s quite an assemblage of colorful stuff for a girl long dead. Maybe shooting from a lower angle up toward the grave marker, with the colorful stuff forming a prominent foreground, might make the shot even more interesting.', '2015-06-18 02:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366213, 1154255, 115814, '<td valign="top">Too many distracting/competing elements...</td>', 'Too many distracting/competing elements...', '2015-06-18 03:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366215, 1153263, 115814, '<td valign="top">The twisting patterns of the bark going up the tree add some interest to an otherwise non-descript scene. The magenta-brown toning above the horizon pulls my attention away.</td>', 'The twisting patterns of the bark going up the tree add some interest to an otherwise non-descript scene. The magenta-brown toning above the horizon pulls my attention away.', '2015-06-18 04:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
