(7366217, 1154551, 115814, '<td valign="top">Nice textures, although the weight of the horizontal mantle across the top (below the skulls) is a strong element that divides attention between top and bottom.</td>', 'Nice textures, although the weight of the horizontal mantle across the top (below the skulls) is a strong element that divides attention between top and bottom.', '2015-06-18 04:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
