(7366335, 1154373, 177322, '<td valign="top">It is a somber image. Her free-flowing cloths are at odds to the rigid geometry of the vaults. While I wasn''t too enraptured by this image initially, the more I have studied it, the more it appeals to me. I hope it does well for you in this challenge.</td>', 'It is a somber image. Her free-flowing cloths are at odds to the rigid geometry of the vaults. While I wasn''t too enraptured by this image initially, the more I have studied it, the more it appeals to me. I hope it does well for you in this challenge.', '2015-06-18 10:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366337, 1154189, 177322, '<td valign="top">While I completely understand your attraction to the sweeping wing, for me personally, it is too dominant in this framing.  What a beautiful monument to study, though.  Were it my find, I would go back again and again in different light, different seasons and make a study of it with multiple angles. How sorrowful this would be with a dark sky, bare trees and some snow.</td>', 'While I completely understand your attraction to the sweeping wing, for me personally, it is too dominant in this framing.  What a beautiful monument to study, though.  Were it my find, I would go back again and again in different light, different seasons and make a study of it with multiple angles. How sorrowful this would be with a dark sky, bare trees and some snow.', '2015-06-18 11:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
