(7368628, 1154311, 62249, '<td valign="top">An interesting (and to me, oddly humorous) monument. The image composition is strange. The vertical split down the middle almost looks as if you spliced two images together. I know you *didn''t*, but that''s the effect you get from the seeming split between nearly black &amp; white on the left and color on the right.</td>', 'An interesting (and to me, oddly humorous) monument. The image composition is strange. The vertical split down the middle almost looks as if you spliced two images together. I know you *didn''t*, but that''s the effect you get from the seeming split between nearly black & white on the left and color on the right.', '2015-06-21 21:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368630, 1154071, 62249, '<td valign="top">The texture overlay hurts rather than helps this image. Likewise the super contrasty processing which has left the image riddled with white specks.</td>', 'The texture overlay hurts rather than helps this image. Likewise the super contrasty processing which has left the image riddled with white specks.', '2015-06-21 21:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368633, 1154496, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good concept to have the ghostly image of the child in the graveyard. Unfortunately, it took me a while to find that part of the image because of the distracting splotch effects added in the sky.</td>', 'Good concept to have the ghostly image of the child in the graveyard. Unfortunately, it took me a while to find that part of the image because of the distracting splotch effects added in the sky.', '2015-06-21 21:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368637, 1153080, 62249, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed. Lackluster composition. Try picking out a single element and making that the subject of the photo.</td>', 'Overprocessed. Lackluster composition. Try picking out a single element and making that the subject of the photo.', '2015-06-21 21:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368639, 1153056, 62249, '<td valign="top">The overhead view is a good idea. Alas, the image looks mostly like a shot of grass.</td>', 'The overhead view is a good idea. Alas, the image looks mostly like a shot of grass.', '2015-06-21 21:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368640, 1153160, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good title. Unremarkable image. Needs more interesting composition.</td>', 'Good title. Unremarkable image. Needs more interesting composition.', '2015-06-21 21:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368642, 1154373, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The vegetation in the middle of the top part of the image competes for the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The vegetation in the middle of the top part of the image competes for the viewer''s attention.', '2015-06-21 21:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368644, 1154334, 62249, '<td valign="top">The stalk of grass in front of the words of the headstone is unfortunate, but the grass seed heads on the right side of the image add an interesting touch.</td>', 'The stalk of grass in front of the words of the headstone is unfortunate, but the grass seed heads on the right side of the image add an interesting touch.', '2015-06-21 21:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368648, 1153484, 62249, '<td valign="top">A different composition would''ve focused viewers more on the photog''s grave. Instead, the white flowers on the grave at the right draw my attention away from your main subject.</td>', 'A different composition would''ve focused viewers more on the photog''s grave. Instead, the white flowers on the grave at the right draw my attention away from your main subject.', '2015-06-21 21:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368653, 1153320, 62249, '<td valign="top">Heh, the third hand is a brilliant touch. Crop photo a bit tighter to get rid of the extraneous vegetation intruding on the upper left corner of the frame.</td>', 'Heh, the third hand is a brilliant touch. Crop photo a bit tighter to get rid of the extraneous vegetation intruding on the upper left corner of the frame.', '2015-06-21 22:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368658, 1153406, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cool. I love the way the lighting hits the right edge of the left-most monument. The backlighting is good around the person, too. Wish there wasn''t quite so much light spillover on the grass.</td>', 'Cool. I love the way the lighting hits the right edge of the left-most monument. The backlighting is good around the person, too. Wish there wasn''t quite so much light spillover on the grass.', '2015-06-21 22:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368662, 1153586, 62249, '<td valign="top">Coooool. Just a slightly tighter crop on both the left and right to eliminate the lighter/darker areas there. I like the good use of blurred foreground, interesting mid ground, and out of focus background. The bird is great. 8.</td>', 'Coooool. Just a slightly tighter crop on both the left and right to eliminate the lighter/darker areas there. I like the good use of blurred foreground, interesting mid ground, and out of focus background. The bird is great. 8.', '2015-06-21 22:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7368766, 1152712, 40391, '<td valign="top">You made me curious and so I did some research about this armstone. Thanks for educating me a bit more about US history. Not a bad shot either.</td>', 'You made me curious and so I did some research about this armstone. Thanks for educating me a bit more about US history. Not a bad shot either.', '2015-06-21 23:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369237, 1154308, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see less empty space bottom left.  Cooked a little long as well.</td>', 'Would have liked to see less empty space bottom left.  Cooked a little long as well.', '2015-06-22 08:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369238, 1154394, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting spot, but processed to death</td>', 'Interesting spot, but processed to death', '2015-06-22 08:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369239, 1154323, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would have loved some light on here to get the many colors to pop.  It sits flat otherwise.  Interesting find though</td>', 'Would have loved some light on here to get the many colors to pop.  It sits flat otherwise.  Interesting find though', '2015-06-22 08:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369241, 1154138, 156466, '<td valign="top">Post on this IR leaves it very midtone heavy and oversharpened.</td>', 'Post on this IR leaves it very midtone heavy and oversharpened.', '2015-06-22 08:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369242, 1154459, 156466, '<td valign="top">Knew I''d see a lot of things like this.  Yours stands out as one of the well processed ones.  Very nice.</td>', 'Knew I''d see a lot of things like this.  Yours stands out as one of the well processed ones.  Very nice.', '2015-06-22 08:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369243, 1154293, 156466, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, but I''m getting more Madonna altar than graveyard from this.</td>', 'Very nice image, but I''m getting more Madonna altar than graveyard from this.', '2015-06-22 08:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369244, 1154324, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little haloing on the tree tops and cross but otherwise nicely processed.</td>', 'A little haloing on the tree tops and cross but otherwise nicely processed.', '2015-06-22 08:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369246, 1154436, 156466, '<td valign="top">Hot spot feels too hot.  Nice idea that missed something in the execution.</td>', 'Hot spot feels too hot.  Nice idea that missed something in the execution.', '2015-06-22 08:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369249, 1154101, 156466, '<td valign="top">Background is a little too over darkened for me.  A little highlight in the clouds would have made if feel less over processed.</td>', 'Background is a little too over darkened for me.  A little highlight in the clouds would have made if feel less over processed.', '2015-06-22 08:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369251, 1153330, 156466, '<td valign="top">Thank you for not over-cooking this.  Nicely framed and processed.</td>', 'Thank you for not over-cooking this.  Nicely framed and processed.', '2015-06-22 08:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369253, 1154301, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not feeling graveyard.  Feels like it could have been taken with a prop on a hike.</td>', 'Not feeling graveyard.  Feels like it could have been taken with a prop on a hike.', '2015-06-22 08:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369255, 1153484, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting monument.  Interesting processing.</td>', 'Interesting monument.  Interesting processing.', '2015-06-22 08:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
