(7369260, 1154236, 156466, '<td valign="top">Like it, but you need to deal with all the sharpening halos, and I''d love to see just a little more detail on the center crucifix. Processed correctly this would have been top 3 for me.</td>', 'Like it, but you need to deal with all the sharpening halos, and I''d love to see just a little more detail on the center crucifix. Processed correctly this would have been top 3 for me.', '2015-06-22 08:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
