(7369262, 1154345, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing.</td>', 'I really like the processing.', '2015-06-22 08:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369264, 1154078, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this looked just a touch brighter against default Photoshop/Lightroom backgrounds.  Just a hair dark for me with the "Light Grey" background here.  Like the Selenium toning.  Top 3 for me.</td>', 'I''m guessing this looked just a touch brighter against default Photoshop/Lightroom backgrounds.  Just a hair dark for me with the "Light Grey" background here.  Like the Selenium toning.  Top 3 for me.', '2015-06-22 08:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369266, 1154264, 156466, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  Not a fan of the processing.</td>', 'Cute title.  Not a fan of the processing.', '2015-06-22 08:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369269, 1153225, 156466, '<td valign="top">It''s going to sound picky, but the umbrella feels small and/or unnecessary.  Otherwise I like it.</td>', 'It''s going to sound picky, but the umbrella feels small and/or unnecessary.  Otherwise I like it.', '2015-06-22 08:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369278, 1153042, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not my favorite look for IR - a little too red but thankfully not cotton candy.  Could use some perspective correction (tilted left) and a white point somewhere (feels midtone heavy).  For me this would have scored well with different processing.  For others I suspect, like mine, this takes hits just for being IR. 6</td>', 'Not my favorite look for IR - a little too red but thankfully not cotton candy.  Could use some perspective correction (tilted left) and a white point somewhere (feels midtone heavy).  For me this would have scored well with different processing.  For others I suspect, like mine, this takes hits just for being IR. 6', '2015-06-22 08:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369279, 1153575, 156466, '<td valign="top">Trying not to obsess on the HDR look, but it works OK for me except on the tree at the left - feels like you worked too hard to lighten it up.  Perspective correction feels overdone as well.</td>', 'Trying not to obsess on the HDR look, but it works OK for me except on the tree at the left - feels like you worked too hard to lighten it up.  Perspective correction feels overdone as well.', '2015-06-22 08:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369280, 1154506, 156466, '<td valign="top">So gray</td>', 'So gray', '2015-06-22 08:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369282, 1154144, 156466, '<td valign="top">So nicely processed that I''m not going to whack you, as some likely did, for not giving me the feel of "graveyard".</td>', 'So nicely processed that I''m not going to whack you, as some likely did, for not giving me the feel of "graveyard".', '2015-06-22 08:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369283, 1153917, 156466, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2015-06-22 08:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369285, 1154607, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but it''s just too dark in the processing for me.  Might just be the light grey background here, but it is.</td>', 'Nice composition but it''s just too dark in the processing for me.  Might just be the light grey background here, but it is.', '2015-06-22 08:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369290, 1153979, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m staring at this and wanting to love it, but it''s just too blurred for me and I suspect from the lines that it was done in post.  I''d love to see this done differently because it''s well seen. 6 as is</td>', 'I''m staring at this and wanting to love it, but it''s just too blurred for me and I suspect from the lines that it was done in post.  I''d love to see this done differently because it''s well seen. 6 as is', '2015-06-22 08:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369292, 1154496, 156466, '<td valign="top">With the texture and the frame it took me a while to see the ghost.  I like the idea and the IR here, but not the treatment.</td>', 'With the texture and the frame it took me a while to see the ghost.  I like the idea and the IR here, but not the treatment.', '2015-06-22 08:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369293, 1153690, 156466, '<td valign="top">Crooked horizon and the reds at the top edge make this not work for me.  Crop down and straighten this goes up 2 points.</td>', 'Crooked horizon and the reds at the top edge make this not work for me.  Crop down and straighten this goes up 2 points.', '2015-06-22 09:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369294, 1154413, 156466, '<td valign="top">IR gives this a nice, eerie feel, but I''m wondering about the choice not to just go B&amp;W with it.  Can''t decide if the imbalance with lack of color to the right is helping or hurting.</td>', 'IR gives this a nice, eerie feel, but I''m wondering about the choice not to just go B&W with it.  Can''t decide if the imbalance with lack of color to the right is helping or hurting.', '2015-06-22 09:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
