(7369298, 1153049, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like IR, but I''m not digging the tonality here.  Different choices in post and maybe a rotate to the right and this would be better for me.</td>', 'I like IR, but I''m not digging the tonality here.  Different choices in post and maybe a rotate to the right and this would be better for me.', '2015-06-22 09:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
