(7369666, 1154436, 16912, '<td valign="top">I did think of something similar but you executed it far better than I could have done so +1.</td>', 'I did think of something similar but you executed it far better than I could have done so +1.', '2015-06-22 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
