(7369715, 1154584, 47974, '<td valign="top">All of the stuff in the background is distracting and you chopped of the front of the grave.  That makes my eyes wander down and try to figure out what the beginning looks like.  A different angle that possibly could cut out that sign we can not read would have really helped as well as a larger aperture to help blur out the background more.</td>', 'All of the stuff in the background is distracting and you chopped of the front of the grave.  That makes my eyes wander down and try to figure out what the beginning looks like.  A different angle that possibly could cut out that sign we can not read would have really helped as well as a larger aperture to help blur out the background more.', '2015-06-22 16:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369723, 1154575, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really great capture and conversion, love the light spotlighting the tombstone.  A few things that could have made it pop a bit more would have been some burning on the light spots in the background and maybe a crop that moved the tombstone a little more left and not so centered.</td>', 'Really great capture and conversion, love the light spotlighting the tombstone.  A few things that could have made it pop a bit more would have been some burning on the light spots in the background and maybe a crop that moved the tombstone a little more left and not so centered.', '2015-06-22 16:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369729, 1154602, 47974, '<td valign="top">Nice conversion and I like how the try divides the photo and the sun is a great added touch.  Nothing you could do, but I wish I could read what''s on the other tombstone.  I see Mother on one but my mind wants something on the other and I leave wanting.</td>', 'Nice conversion and I like how the try divides the photo and the sun is a great added touch.  Nothing you could do, but I wish I could read what''s on the other tombstone.  I see Mother on one but my mind wants something on the other and I leave wanting.', '2015-06-22 16:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369737, 1153056, 47974, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and the conversion.  There are a few distracting spots in the grass that could have been fixed.  Other then that, great capture.</td>', 'Love the perspective and the conversion.  There are a few distracting spots in the grass that could have been fixed.  Other then that, great capture.', '2015-06-22 16:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369749, 1154311, 47974, '<td valign="top">Perfect perspective and crop, love the coloring on the tombstone.  Now the guys face is a little beyond creepy.  This would have been so much better if you had converted the right half to B&amp;W but kept the tombstone as is, the color on the right is kind of distracting.</td>', 'Perfect perspective and crop, love the coloring on the tombstone.  Now the guys face is a little beyond creepy.  This would have been so much better if you had converted the right half to B&W but kept the tombstone as is, the color on the right is kind of distracting.', '2015-06-22 17:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369750, 1154606, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really love the processing on this one.  The perspective is interesting but it seems more about the big plant then about the tombstone.</td>', 'Really love the processing on this one.  The perspective is interesting but it seems more about the big plant then about the tombstone.', '2015-06-22 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369752, 1154591, 47974, '<td valign="top">I am going to guess that you did the processing with some sort of filter then when in and lightened up some of the tombstones to draw attention to them.  While it does have a spooky look to, the processing does nothing for me.</td>', 'I am going to guess that you did the processing with some sort of filter then when in and lightened up some of the tombstones to draw attention to them.  While it does have a spooky look to, the processing does nothing for me.', '2015-06-22 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369753, 1154608, 47974, '<td valign="top">The really low perspective and distance from the tombstones makes the photo more about the tree then the tombstones.</td>', 'The really low perspective and distance from the tombstones makes the photo more about the tree then the tombstones.', '2015-06-22 17:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7369756, 1154480, 47974, '<td valign="top">I typically do not like this style of processing but for this shot it really works, especially with the light coming in the center of the photo.  The building sort of bothers me with the lean it appears to have.  Not sure if it is from distortion or if it really is leaning.</td>', 'I typically do not like this style of processing but for this shot it really works, especially with the light coming in the center of the photo.  The building sort of bothers me with the lean it appears to have.  Not sure if it is from distortion or if it really is leaning.', '2015-06-22 17:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
