(7370483, 1153320, 70270, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed and exposed, and a good effort but one that ultimately comes up short for me.  The blood on her mouth looks fake and the angle of the extra hand is strange ... you have to look hard to realize its Kelly''s hand, because at first it just looks like your model''s hand held at an odd angle.  I gather this is supposed to be a zombie shot not a suicide image, although it appears on first blush to be the latter and the title doesn''t help (seems to say "can I help you off yourself?").  My first reaction though was I didn''t like it because I found the suicide context to be disrespectful and offputting; only after looking longer did I realize you were going for something different.  6 for effort.</td>', 'This is nicely composed and exposed, and a good effort but one that ultimately comes up short for me.  The blood on her mouth looks fake and the angle of the extra hand is strange ... you have to look hard to realize its Kelly''s hand, because at first it just looks like your model''s hand held at an odd angle.  I gather this is supposed to be a zombie shot not a suicide image, although it appears on first blush to be the latter and the title doesn''t help (seems to say "can I help you off yourself?").  My first reaction though was I didn''t like it because I found the suicide context to be disrespectful and offputting; only after looking longer did I realize you were going for something different.  6 for effort.', '2015-06-23 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
