(7370496, 1154323, 70270, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge at all imo, and even if it did you didn''t do anything to really find or compose an interesting image.  Its just a bad snapshot of a bunch of old bikes.  I hope you were going for the brown, because that''s what you got from me.  Sorry if you weren''t.  1</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge at all imo, and even if it did you didn''t do anything to really find or compose an interesting image.  Its just a bad snapshot of a bunch of old bikes.  I hope you were going for the brown, because that''s what you got from me.  Sorry if you weren''t.  1', '2015-06-23 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
