(7370709, 1154317, 47974, '<td valign="top">This would have been so much better without the person in it and maybe B&amp;W.  The person seems so off to me because this is a very old graveyard that looks completely overrun with weeds.  Why someone would be mourning at a grave that appears to be 100 years old does not make sense to me.  Without the person (but keep the rose) this could have been one of my favorite.</td>', 'This would have been so much better without the person in it and maybe B&W.  The person seems so off to me because this is a very old graveyard that looks completely overrun with weeds.  Why someone would be mourning at a grave that appears to be 100 years old does not make sense to me.  Without the person (but keep the rose) this could have been one of my favorite.', '2015-06-23 18:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
