(7370716, 1154011, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot and love the perspective taken.  I really wish you had shot this a little more to the right so that the cross was more or less framed by the that steam running across it and the flower to the right.  As is, my eye struggles to find a place to rest.  The shifted shot would have also put less of the blown out sky in the photo, which is pretty distracting and if anywhere that is where my eye goes.</td>', 'Very cool shot and love the perspective taken.  I really wish you had shot this a little more to the right so that the cross was more or less framed by the that steam running across it and the flower to the right.  As is, my eye struggles to find a place to rest.  The shifted shot would have also put less of the blown out sky in the photo, which is pretty distracting and if anywhere that is where my eye goes.', '2015-06-23 18:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
