(7371818, 1153049, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>As far as the overall scene goes, great shot. Your setup is nice and your crop is good for me. However, The tones are definitely off. The trees and grass for me are just wrong. I''ve never shot IR so I don''t really know what goes into post processing but I would like to see this shot with the tones changed. I do think you scored about right on this one. Experiment with it some and see what you can come with. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... As far as the overall scene goes, great shot. Your setup is nice and your crop is good for me. However, The tones are definitely off. The trees and grass for me are just wrong. I''ve never shot IR so I don''t really know what goes into post processing but I would like to see this shot with the tones changed. I do think you scored about right on this one. Experiment with it some and see what you can come with. Happy shooting', '2015-06-24 13:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
