(7373177, 1154345, 180696, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> what is she holding with her left hand? is that a reflected smile of a ghost. well modelled and disturbing for reasons I''d rather not say. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is a Trumpet</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: what is she holding with her left hand? is that a reflected smile of a ghost. well modelled and disturbing for reasons I''d rather not say.   It is a Trumpet', '2015-06-26 05:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373392, 1154459, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding image, Sara. Beautifully composed and processed. Nice job on the ribbon and bling.</td>', 'This is an outstanding image, Sara. Beautifully composed and processed. Nice job on the ribbon and bling.', '2015-06-26 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373536, 1154581, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>1st of all for me the shot seems a little bit too dark. ( I know it is a b&amp;w but I think it would have looked better slightly lighter). Unlike one of your comments below, I don''t have a problem with the bright spots through the trees.....However, your camera angle I believe could have been altered to make a more powerful picture. <br/> <br/>On a different note, I am not understanding your title.....However, I never score or critique based on the title. <br/> <br/>I hope this was helpful to you. Keep shooting....</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... 1st of all for me the shot seems a little bit too dark. ( I know it is a b&w but I think it would have looked better slightly lighter). Unlike one of your comments below, I don''t have a problem with the bright spots through the trees.....However, your camera angle I believe could have been altered to make a more powerful picture.  On a different note, I am not understanding your title.....However, I never score or critique based on the title.  I hope this was helpful to you. Keep shooting....', '2015-06-26 12:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373550, 1154413, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>OK my 1st word that comes to mind when I see this picture is peaceful or tranquil. Personally I think IR works very nicely with this shot. I would like to say that your setup was very nice. I think that you captured this at a very nice angle. The only problem I see, and for this one it''s not much of a problem, is it looks to me to a little too dark on the extreme bottom right and extreme top right. Again I don''t think that really hurts this pic. <br/> <br/>Keep it up nice shot. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... OK my 1st word that comes to mind when I see this picture is peaceful or tranquil. Personally I think IR works very nicely with this shot. I would like to say that your setup was very nice. I think that you captured this at a very nice angle. The only problem I see, and for this one it''s not much of a problem, is it looks to me to a little too dark on the extreme bottom right and extreme top right. Again I don''t think that really hurts this pic.  Keep it up nice shot. Happy shooting.', '2015-06-26 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373563, 1153360, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Special note* I had almost forgotten that Jimi was buried there. I am also a Hendrix fan.<br/> <br/>On to the pic...The colors are quite nice. I like the contrast between the green grass and the purple flowers. "purple haze" For the most part the detail is good. However, the clouds seem a little bit blah to me. Also I like your crop. I think that turned out nicely.<br/> <br/>Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Special note* I had almost forgotten that Jimi was buried there. I am also a Hendrix fan. On to the pic...The colors are quite nice. I like the contrast between the green grass and the purple flowers. "purple haze" For the most part the detail is good. However, the clouds seem a little bit blah to me. Also I like your crop. I think that turned out nicely. Happy shooting', '2015-06-26 12:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373590, 1154169, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Janine....you have done a good job on this shot. I love the antique feel. It fits the image very well. You have plenty of detail over the entire shot. The overall composition is well done. I think choosing b&amp;w was a good choice for this shot. Keep it up and happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Janine....you have done a good job on this shot. I love the antique feel. It fits the image very well. You have plenty of detail over the entire shot. The overall composition is well done. I think choosing b&w was a good choice for this shot. Keep it up and happy shooting.', '2015-06-26 13:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373718, 1154078, 31637, '<td valign="top">Love it. Nice to see you back on top :)</td>', 'Love it. Nice to see you back on top :)', '2015-06-26 15:42:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373776, 1154175, 29011, '<td valign="top">An excellent capture. Beautiful warm tones and glow. Underscored but nice top10 finish :)</td>', 'An excellent capture. Beautiful warm tones and glow. Underscored but nice top10 finish :)', '2015-06-26 17:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373941, 1153406, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful</td>', 'This is really beautiful', '2015-06-27 01:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7374351, 1154193, 67697, '<td valign="top">I fail to see why this is a below 5 shot.  I liked it for the different perspective.</td>', 'I fail to see why this is a below 5 shot.  I liked it for the different perspective.', '2015-06-27 16:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7374371, 1153690, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is where facebook comes in handy.  We''d get to read the story at the same time as looking at the photo.  So much more meaningful that just an entry.  I love this moment that you captured.  And hugs to you.</td>', 'This is where facebook comes in handy.  We''d get to read the story at the same time as looking at the photo.  So much more meaningful that just an entry.  I love this moment that you captured.  And hugs to you.', '2015-06-27 17:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7379037, 1153955, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>"pushing up daisies" That was a perfectly chosen title. I do like the single headstone. Very good subject for this challenge. The flowers are very nice. You were able to capture all the colors accurately. Also the lighting seems to be very nice. Again job well done. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... "pushing up daisies" That was a perfectly chosen title. I do like the single headstone. Very good subject for this challenge. The flowers are very nice. You were able to capture all the colors accurately. Also the lighting seems to be very nice. Again job well done. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-01 11:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7379150, 1154585, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>This is a very different type of shot. To tell you the truth I really don''t know what to think of it. It''s creepy / spooky. I really don''t think that it fits into the graveyard challenge and unfortunately your score shows it. However, I do see where you were going with this. "white ghosts rising up" All I can say is it was entertaining to see this. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... This is a very different type of shot. To tell you the truth I really don''t know what to think of it. It''s creepy / spooky. I really don''t think that it fits into the graveyard challenge and unfortunately your score shows it. However, I do see where you were going with this. "white ghosts rising up" All I can say is it was entertaining to see this. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-01 12:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7379708, 1154444, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nikki (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=138630" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nam</a> is right:  what a dignified scene.  The clover growing amongst the monuments somehow softens the solemnity.  Your B&amp;W work is remarkable and the composition is creative - starting the leading line of the path in the center - plus, the image is sharp.  Frankly, looking at this now, I am surprised it did not rank higher.</td>', 'Nikki ( nam is right:  what a dignified scene.  The clover growing amongst the monuments somehow softens the solemnity.  Your B&W work is remarkable and the composition is creative - starting the leading line of the path in the center - plus, the image is sharp.  Frankly, looking at this now, I am surprised it did not rank higher.', '2015-07-02 00:58:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7381697, 1154345, 75618, '<td valign="top">The lighting is obviously from the camera flash which makes the whole statue look flat. The image itself is nothing but a boring, uninspired depiction of someone else''s work. Nice try though.</td>', 'The lighting is obviously from the camera flash which makes the whole statue look flat. The image itself is nothing but a boring, uninspired depiction of someone else''s work. Nice try though.', '2015-07-04 08:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7655428, 1154575, 100831, '<td valign="top">The light makes this.. a sensitive image and I scored it well. Not sure I understand the title.</td>', 'The light makes this.. a sensitive image and I scored it well. Not sure I understand the title.', '2020-03-15 00:38:30.000000', NULL, 0);
